rooms_desc ({"As you leave the portal you entered to get here and look around you can seeyou are on the ground and bobo's house is atop a small amount of stairsconnecting to a porch.  the portal is part of a statue of some sort and thereis a porch swing on the veranda.","When in doubt tell the truth","As i drive from your pearly gates i realize that i just can't stay.  Allthose mountains kept you locked inside and hid the truth from my slighted eyes.  I came to you with a half-open heart, dreams upon myback illusions of a brand new start.  Nashville, I can't carry the load.  Is it my fault that i can't reap what i sow?  Nashville didyou give me half a chance with your southern style and your hidden dance?  All those voices, they whisper through my walls, they talkof falling fast, they say i'm losing it all.  They say i'm running blind to a love of my own but i'll be walking proud, i'm saving whatI still own.  I fell on my knees to kiss your land, but you are sofar down i can't even see to stand.  Nashville you forgot the humanrace, you see with half a mind.  What colors hide the face?Nashville i'd like to know your fate.  I'd like to stay awhile buti've seen your lowered state.  Today i'm leaving but i've got all these debts to pay.  We all have our dues, i'll pay them some otherplace.  I never ask that you pay me back, we all arrive with more Ileft with less than i had.  your town is weak from people walking through, last chance for a cause well i thought i knew.  I'm running away.","in the center of this room is a nice hot large hot tub.  It looks as ifit could hold many people and yet is personal enough for two.  There ismarble style tiling around it for about five feet.  Surrounding that isnice plush new carpet.  There is a fire place in the center of the westwall.  There is a wet bar in the north-west corner.  There is a big bearrug in front of the fire place.  This room is very cozy and dimly light.there is a radio built into the south wall.","hi there have fun.","This room is so sad and unhappy.  is there no way to cheer it up? it hasnothing while it feels society has everything that's not fair is it?  Pleaseplease make this room happy and it will love you forever.","As you enter this room you think to yourself'This is a big room.'  It hasall the amenities of a normal bedroom except on a grand scale.  You feellike Goldilocks siting in Papa Bears chair not overwhelmingly large butdefinately noticable.  The bed is in the south eastern corner.  It is surprisingly small in comparison with the rest of the room perhaps 1.5times the size of a twin size bed.  There is a closet in the south wall.There is a large desk on the west wall.  There is a huge dresser on thenorth wall next to the door.  The vast majority of the room is emptymaking the dwarfing quality all the more noticable.","As you enter the pool the heat makes you want to get into somethin a littleless bulky.  You see two locker rooms along the south wall maybe you shouldgo get changed.  The pool itself is eight lanes and is 25 yards long.  Thereis a big high-tech score board on the west wall ready to display any results.There is a dingy little man underneath operating it.  Also along the west wallis a lane line holder.  Along the east wall is patio furniture includingchairs, recliners, and tables where you can watch people swimming.","this will be detailed later","If I can't love youI don't want to love youIf I can't hold youI don't want to be thinking of youAnd if you don't want meI don't want to want youAnd if you won't see meI don't know what to doBut I keep watching youOh I keep watching youUntil I see right throughOh I keep watching you.",})
rooms_short ({"The entrance way of the famous Bobo","dining room","Nashville - Indigo Girls","This is the hot tub room.  Remember some like it hot some like it not","living room","The really Sad room. how sad","This is the master bedroom","This is an olypic size swimming pool","kitchen","hmm.",})
